vernovas-reinvention-and-600-stock-spike/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗希望对霍尔木兹海峡实施黑手党式的“保护”收费，但每年 200 亿美元的损失只是一个白日梦</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/iran-mafia-protection-toll-strait-hormuz-eye-popping-20-billion/</link><description>任何收费或自愿收费制度的细节都不太可能在任何潜在的临时协议中最终确定，从而进一步推迟永久和平解决方案。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289908031-e1786484723238.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:08:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/iran-mafia-protection-toll-strait-hormuz-eye-popping-20-billion/</guid></item><item><title>忘掉晚会吧，这些硅谷学校经营着自己的风险投资基金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/forget-the-gala-these-silicon-valley-schools-run-their-own-venture-capital-funds/</link><description>湾区的一些精英学校已经从红杉资本、Lightspeed 和 Battery 等公司招募了家长捐助者，引导少量捐赠资金投入早期初创企业。随着大规模首次公开募股重新流行，学校正在为接下来可能发生的事情做好准备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SFHS_StudentsinCommons_NowandForever-e1786485382417.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/forget-the-gala-these-silicon-valley-schools-run-their-own-venture-capital-funds/</guid></item><item><title>大学正在买卖数据中心的财产，引发人们对人工智能人才流失的担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/george-washington-university-of-michigan-property-sale-ai-data-center-development/</link><description>乔治华盛顿大学最近将其弗吉尼亚校区出售给亚马逊，密歇根大学提议耗资 12 亿美元开发新的数据中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2215736974-e1786475943838.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/george-washington-university-of-michigan-property-sale-ai-data-center-development/</guid></item></channel></rss>